  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "One of his most unexpected records: in New York, Hadjidakis writes and orchestrates songs for the rock band New York Rock & Roll Ensemble (Op. 27), with English lyrics by the band's members — among them Michael Kamen on keyboards. He also produced it.",
      "In 1993 the cycle would be reborn in Greek as “Antikatoptrismoi”, with lyrics by Nikos Gatsos and Agathi Dimitrouka — “Kemal” becoming “Κεμάλ”."
